{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "a606b1491cacabc6a8bba4a05c65e65b37637f5b09fdbb65be8a335369f5a375", "ja": "それぞれが目指すもの", "zh": "各自的目标", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "61395beebc02b005eff6ab6bcc674f7452d4e8a843cf9744f1ba6b5c8352170d", "ja": "琴葉、美奈子と合同練習をする未来達。特訓\nを難なくこなす翼に気圧される静香。帰り道\nにて、未来と静香は、目指すアイドル像を語\nり合う。楽観的な未来に、静香は苛立ちを隠\nせず、きつい言葉をぶつけてしまう。", "zh": "未来等人与琴叶、美奈子进行联合练习。面对轻松完成特训\n的翼，静香感到一阵压力。回去的路上，未来和静香谈论\n着自己心目中想成为的偶像。面对乐观的未来，静香无法掩\n饰自己的烦躁，忍不住对她说出了尖锐的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c5b072479fe55c38fc29956cfc5c2109a4eed2f933d20dc36b7674b6f177cd71", "ja": "（ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブ出場に向けて、\n未来、静香、翼のユニットが始動した）", "zh": "（为了参加下一届偶像浪潮，未来、静香和翼的组合开始行动了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "7d35436816d4a99a473bf28513b5fba97fe43b8413444781170e91e5526e4709", "ja": "（緊張感の漂う静香、やる気十分の翼に比べると、\n未来の様子は今のところ普段どおりだな）", "zh": "（和散发着紧张气氛的静香、干劲十足的翼相比，\n未来目前看起来还是和平时一样啊。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8831ba5b5d17b7d1cfa94290ac756312a5d91fbd5c489c91b29cbea9447ec9e8", "ja": "えっと、今日のレッスンは……『合同練習』？\nあれ、わたしたちだけじゃないんですか～？", "zh": "那个，今天的课程是……“联合练习”？\n咦，不只是我们吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3ba6470878a5699a5727b3f27747e34aa9c6ed7f9fc0d1d198eedd93f21de956", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。公演に向けて練習するのは、\n翼たちだけじゃないからな。今日一緒なのは……。", "zh": "啊，是这样。为了公演而练习的，不只是翼她们。今天要一起练习的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1004_017kth", "source_sha256": "8442856c5f3bb6072b3e79cd1840de6128b57238bf316d88de7ee67ec3c71ef0", "ja": "来たわね、未来！", "zh": "你来了，未来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "4501e32900d7041fe6638763f3c2f5a297f8640ba20123d766ab415a7d62d824", "ja": "来ちゃったね、未来ちゃん！", "zh": "未来，你来了呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "f6e6509e1fa55cc1cdadc3a031cb90bc254fc7b65347503ead0f00ee2b0e4a3e", "ja": "琴葉ちゃんに、美奈子ちゃん！\nわぁ、今日はふたりがいっしょなんだね♪", "zh": "琴叶，还有美奈子！\n哇，今天你们两个在一起呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "34bbf55d97afb682c4798373e3447097b6c2d019cce291f3e13b5ff3ff14160a", "ja": "ふふ、そうだよ。{$P$}が、\n合同練習を組んでくれたんだ。", "zh": "呵呵，是啊。{$P$}先生帮我们安排了联合练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9d8b6836fb480993c3da717f12f997a8680c5afa7864cb0d7793b74f74e1e3b5", "ja": "みんなそれぞれ学校や仕事があるし、\nレッスンできる時間は限られているからな。", "zh": "大家各有各的学业和工作，\n能用来练习的时间很有限嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1009_p", "source_sha256": "caaa379d406bc89b53e98376953734929c30ebd1d1b65206b729b20145c2728c", "ja": "なので、合同練習してもらう事にした。もちろん\n後半は、ユニットごとの練習が増えるだろうけどな！", "zh": "所以，我决定让大家进行合练。当然，后半阶段按组合进行的练习会增加吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "dda9f8e7498e99087d1b4a8e9f65a9444b1a6019253410217c4e641d8ffbfcff", "ja": "私はオペラセリア・煌輝座……志保ちゃん、歌織さん、\nまつりちゃんと出場だから未来とはライバルだけどね。", "zh": "我是Opera Seria·煌辉座……要和志保、歌织、茉莉一起参赛，所以和未来是对手呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "a4352ce873053b6d03b4170493e3bb2ec0a17b88132f09078d7d3c643b6eda0b", "ja": "私と奈緒ちゃんは、Jus-2-Mintだよ！\n今日は手加減ナシで、ガンガン行くからね～！", "zh": "我和奈绪是Jus-2-Mint哦！今天可不会手下留情，要火力全开地上啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b88b1b0275c3a904bbb455c159f8244b980619a3833490ccda752d3a90d400cb", "ja": "そっか～。でもわたしたちだって、負けないですよ！\nこっちには未来も、静香ちゃんもいるんだし！", "zh": "这样啊～不过我们也不会输的哦！\n我们这边还有未来和静香呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "668cc1a39647d88dbdac1c259410adfbaa9d47f8c7eb763d3cea9d6969bbba84", "ja": "翼ちゃん、気合いが入ってるね！　それじゃさっそく、\n公演に向けて……まずは走り込みから行くよ！", "zh": "翼，你干劲十足嘛！那我们马上开始，为了公演……先从跑步训练开始吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "2340520c45e38b49069c1a2d7605da9fcf735438fff9bd42a767dcbb49e5452b", "ja": "ハァ、ハァ、ハァ……。\nこ、こんなに走ったの、久しぶりかも……。", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……  \n好久没跑这么久了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "9449b0bf3e4333dda99b620ac5cbc0edfb5e8d67bb7d0fce78e305a240002f13", "ja": "わたしも～……。でも最後のほう、\nなんか面白くなってきちゃった♪", "zh": "我也是～……不过跑到最后，\n不知怎么的，感觉还挺有意思的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "c9b72b28746b2707f248b9400efd66c6bd10b0919c360dcad0216946755fe232", "ja": "3人とも、走り込みにはしっかりついて\nこられたみたいだね。", "zh": "你们3个人，看来都有好好跟上长跑呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "4d32f9eb18b6fee82a4c622ec056bc7f40c67abd266dbf5ee9ce29eb4b3b094d", "ja": "うんうん♪　基礎体力もバッチリついてるし、\nこれなら特訓もいけると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯嗯♪基础体力也锻炼得棒棒的，这样的话，特训应该也没问题了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "3b6abddf139763be73e9d13f77f94fe50b141edb43d85fd328630a48d1cf9f91", "ja": "え？　特訓って……。", "zh": "诶？特训是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1020_017kth", "source_sha256": "1920fce218695425702d168a40297d08ff449633e1448a23bcca1f5f812c6b75", "ja": "もちろん、特訓は特訓だよ。\nさあ、レッスンルームに移動しましょう！", "zh": "当然是字面意义上的特训啦。\n好，我们去练习室吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1021_014mir", "source_sha256": "9ed7debfb1565152caa426465a5bffe7a1131b6b233083116ee02f62342cab21", "ja": "い、今から～！？", "zh": "现、现在就要开始吗～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1022_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c38381ee75bcb0987ba4490be00923ff1190f889d48cdedfeb8c213c831a789e", "ja": "よし、今日のレッスンはこれで終わりだな。\nみんな、本当にお疲れさま！", "zh": "好，今天的课程就到此为止了。\n大家真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "262602b2a59e7d27053ff3660df5c09c4911b4a6ae19a8ad3f2739584f93639b", "ja": "全力で走り込みした後のダンスレッスンは、\nさすがにきつかったかな。私もクタクタ……。", "zh": "全力跑步训练后的舞蹈课，确实挺累的吧。我也累得筋疲力尽了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "a6b533b38db69bb755cb8f350a728a01618849214cb83ce9e5af106388bba9bc", "ja": "帰ったらゆっくりお風呂に入って、体を休めてね。\nあ、でも翼ちゃんは、まだ元気かも？", "zh": "回去之后好好泡个澡，让身体休息一下吧。\n啊，不过翼可能还很有精神？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1026_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1900f58190f61f5f61396fd8f9f57b0be54778a8d731a819c10a7444b8ac62c7", "ja": "うん！　だって特訓する前より、\nすっごくいいカンジになったな～って思うし♪", "zh": "嗯！因为我觉得，和特训之前相比，感觉变得特别棒了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "ad0d899a436fc0c1b88295873737394853690f8ed1a755c8f435c6b4a9f396a1", "ja": "レッスンしても、全然変わらないのはつまんないけど。\nちゃんと上手になったって思えるのは、楽しいもん♪", "zh": "就算进行了训练，一点变化都没有的话也很无聊。\n但能切实感受到自己变厉害了，就会很开心嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1028_015siz", "source_sha256": "60826181b3f6b4e29081c445e47c93c9c614143f6e9c85fa26a421301187d85e", "ja": "……やっぱり、翼は違うわね。\nすごいな……。", "zh": "……翼果然不一样呢。\n真厉害啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "24907093ae1253bdf2d9c5f26701d9d3eb870451eeb6ab828b9ddf818d8fd73c", "ja": "静香ちゃん……？", "zh": "静香……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1030_014mir", "source_sha256": "185c916c62f2a4c27cb1fd533fd0eaa8b3362f431416a55a66617b92c5d92cd0", "ja": "うう……。つ、疲れたぁ～……。\n1日目からこんなハードだとは思わなかったよ～。", "zh": "呜呜……好、好累啊～……\n没想到从第1天开始就这么严苛呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "75cdb62a06116c854bc572ee16a8222e6f87cb9207a395bb85a18317e20fd488", "ja": "そうね……。琴葉さんレベルの訓練となると、\nさすがにきつかったかな……。", "zh": "是啊……。要进行琴叶小姐那种程度的训练，果然还是挺辛苦的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "09fd598141fccc74cbe52941516f4d12423108eb2ccb757a73838f5e7d7d31df", "ja": "でもでも！　私、今日1日で、\nダンスすっごく上手になった気がする！", "zh": "不过不过！今天是第1天，我感觉自己的舞跳得特别好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1033_014mir", "source_sha256": "b379fb0a73965a9561c3e1effabc5a0df9d75749e4799fb0f318a3d3de97cb12", "ja": "この調子でいったら、\nいつか静香ちゃんを超えちゃうかも！", "zh": "照这样下去，说不定哪天就能超过静香了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1034_015siz", "source_sha256": "853a7a1e35ceb3cded73474ee1aac6e5a52470c10746ca454eb2e1c5e218fff2", "ja": "ふっ……ふふっ。まったく、未来は調子いいんだから。\nでも、いつもそのくらいの気持ちでいてほしいな。", "zh": "呵……呵呵。真是的，未来总是这么会说。\n不过，我希望你一直都能保持这样的心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1035_014mir", "source_sha256": "a197be222cfee3e2394d7c3edafccc8f6c95d4663018f52fc163119222d6eb46", "ja": "……静香ちゃんは、いつもがんばってるよね。\nすごいなぁって思う。", "zh": "……静香一直都很努力呢。\n我觉得好厉害啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1036_015siz", "source_sha256": "4fdadf1f4614993d7ad421ea62c737425b51c28a033676b8afe0e854698b6a84", "ja": "それは……前にも話したでしょう。私には、早く\n結果を出さなきゃいけない理由があるから……。", "zh": "那件事……之前不是说过了吗？因为我有必须尽快做出成绩的理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1037_015siz", "source_sha256": "5ee5014d031a2d7e86b89fa31092a872dedd86d310075541b2e9b62ddc23d012", "ja": "ネクスト・アイドル・ウェーブは、チャンスだもの。\nここで結果を出せば、絶対に認めてもらえるはず……。", "zh": "Next・偶像・Wave可是个机会啊。只要在这里取得成果，就一定能得到认可……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1038_015siz", "source_sha256": "02f7cc948091f0c448588dbfd092e3a4909d69e2e4fd9104493be1a149917e1f", "ja": "……ねえ、未来。\n未来はどうして、アイドルになろうと思ったの？", "zh": "……我说，未来。\n未来你为什么会想成为偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "5f77a6a49ed473f4d0782d4ef58d3b43f969fa0c33706443273217db67f3eb0b", "ja": "えっ。どうしたの、急に。", "zh": "诶，怎么了，突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "197ea83ffbd97ed0f2c22b6fc3055bfea3c9028b86d7cde19ea79acebffd0790", "ja": "ううん。何となくだけど……\nちゃんと話したことはなかったなって思って。", "zh": "不是，只是隐约觉得……\n我们好像从来没有好好聊过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1041_014mir", "source_sha256": "78e459af543f4a02eb7e4a5070b5fa22e86d0aee00c7f34c2b3600484c437aaf", "ja": "私は……なんでアイドルになろうと思ったんだろ？\n楽しそうだと思ったから……？　よく覚えてないや。", "zh": "我……为什么会想成为偶像呢？是因为觉得很开心……？我也记不太清了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1042_015siz", "source_sha256": "0345349f2fdef0e32e86aea4473285d5db67ec0398ff77658a76e0db495803cc", "ja": "覚えてないって……。じゃあ未来は、\n目的もわからずにレッスンや仕事をしてるの？", "zh": "记不得了……那未来现在是在不知道目的的情况下，就这样参加练习和工作吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1043_014mir", "source_sha256": "ff42fd4cbb2c72dfdfc4ede50b9e88bde32e420de7a91b7c3fd36ef240c0784d", "ja": "そうなのかな？　でもアイドルやる前より、毎日楽しい\nかも！　劇場で、友達も、たーっくさんできたし♪", "zh": "是这样吗？不过，比起当偶像以前，我每天都开心多了\n也说不定！在剧场里，还交到了好多好多朋友♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "110ceb0db61db2c12f18763a802210d6f0f1b1f1c02e905966d3160dcc6ad504", "ja": "……なら、未来は、\nずっと劇場のアイドルでいればいいじゃない。", "zh": "……那未来，\n就一直当剧场的偶像不就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1045_014mir", "source_sha256": "0829c63de940450502f69078927c70cb5937807cd50966f8995aee8a4b5c7364", "ja": "え……？　う、うん。そうだけど……\n静香ちゃんは、それじゃイヤなの？", "zh": "诶……？嗯、嗯。是这样没错……静香，你不喜欢这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1046_015siz", "source_sha256": "7c69b4ecd60ee8d966a077696c7f1602d230f81f81c037aec8c42950a96b7e77", "ja": "イヤよ。私だって、劇場は大好き。でも、\nずっと劇場の中だけのアイドルではいたくはないの。", "zh": "不要。我也非常喜欢剧场。但是，我不想永远只当一个局限于剧场里的偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1047_015siz", "source_sha256": "b6b9010d0b5acb0f44acfd24f55161baeb11ef2862de83c8b298406767a0c15f", "ja": "私はもっと、自分の可能性を信じたい。\nもっと大きな舞台で歌いたい。", "zh": "我想更加相信自己的可能性。\n想在更大的舞台上歌唱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "ab4347f37c11bbb83c0b8653164c75f209fb8cbe8d055cb977f0602ba1d333af", "ja": "私と未来は、同じ劇場のアイドルだけど。\n目指しているものが違うみたい。", "zh": "虽然我和未来都是同一家剧场的偶像，\n但我们追求的目标似乎不一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1049_015siz", "source_sha256": "0f4fbfbc41b2742288280a4c4532bcbf92ab520224dd070a446d7283e773929d", "ja": "今は同じユニットを組んで、一緒にいるけど……\nいつかは、別れることになるかも。", "zh": "现在虽然组成了同一个组合，待在一起……\n但总有一天，也许会分开。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1050_014mir", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1051_015siz", "source_sha256": "4e6431392e1756accaf57eae2af8d1639c42a112ffb4f01399466c7bcc5365db", "ja": "ごめん、変な話しちゃった。今日はもう帰るわ。\nじゃあね、未来。また明日、レッスンで。", "zh": "对不起，聊了些奇怪的话。今天我就先回去了。\n那明天见，未来。明天上课时见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "9811d46d09c8e2a306625c4c2269e6906d554e945328984b65bc54d18fa7de43", "ja": "う、うん……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0181_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0181_story_02_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "8b253847e5975ee56b0064400f1fefc56b5792a838f46684d2b8a4c87b780607", "ja": "私……今のままじゃ、ダメなのかな……。", "zh": "我……现在这样，是不行的吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
